@startuml

title PENA POC 01 — Toolchain and Developer Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

skinparam node {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

skinparam component {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

skinparam database {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #FFFCE8
}

skinparam cloud {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #F2F2F2
}

actor "Developer / Architect" as Dev
actor "AI Coding Assistant" as AI

node "Developer MacBook" as LAPTOP {

  component "VS Code" as VSCODE
  component "GitHub Copilot" as COPILOT
  component "Terminal" as TERM
  component "PlantUML Preview" as PLANTUML
  component "Python venv" as VENV
  component "pytest" as PYTEST

}

cloud "ChatGPT / Claude / Codex" as CHATTOOLS
node "GitHub Repository" as GITHUB
database "Specs / UML" as SPECS
database "Source Code" as SRC
database "Runtime Outputs" as OUTPUT
database "Observability Reports" as OBS

Dev --> VSCODE : edit specs/code
Dev --> TERM : run commands
Dev --> PLANTUML : inspect diagrams

AI --> COPILOT : inline coding help
AI --> CHATTOOLS : design/refinement help

VSCODE --> COPILOT : assisted edits
VSCODE --> GITHUB : push / pull
GITHUB --> SPECS
GITHUB --> SRC

TERM --> VENV : activate runtime
TERM --> PYTEST : run tests
TERM --> SRC : execute POC CLI

SRC --> OUTPUT : markdown digest
SRC --> OBS : JSON/log reports

PLANTUML --> SPECS : render .puml

note bottom of LAPTOP
POC 01 development is local-first:
VS Code + Git + Python + UML + AI assistance.
end note

note right of GITHUB
The repository remains the source of truth
for specs, code, tests, outputs, and learning.
end note

@enduml
